WEBVTT

NOTE dashboard-overview: written VO text from episode.json, timed from the timeline VO placements

V0-1
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:05.030
The whole feature lives on one screen.

V0-2
00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:08.310
Here is what each of its
four regions is telling you.

V1a-1
00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:16.893
Start with the toolbar. Its left
side identifies where you are:

V1a-2
00:00:16.993 --> 00:00:19.638
the site name, and a
course selector that only

V1a-3
00:00:19.738 --> 00:00:22.730
appears when the site has
more than one Lynx course.

V1b-1
00:00:23.286 --> 00:00:27.991
Next to it, the weather strip reports
current conditions, and the average, high

V1b-2
00:00:28.091 --> 00:00:32.796
and low VWC summarise the areas of the
selected course that were scanned today.

V2a-1
00:00:38.853 --> 00:00:43.034
Each sprinkler of a station scanned
in the past seven days is a pin.

V2a-2
00:00:43.134 --> 00:00:47.868
A pin scanned today is coloured by its
measured VWC against the four moisture

V2a-3
00:00:47.968 --> 00:00:52.703
bands in the legend, and a pin last
scanned on an earlier day is drawn clear.

V2b-1
00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:58.107
Bands default to 0 to 5, 6 to 19,
20 to 30 and above 30 percent.

V2b-2
00:00:58.207 --> 00:01:04.480
Disabled stations stay hidden while Layers
is set to Enabled Stations, the default.

V3a-1
00:01:12.786 --> 00:01:16.438
The chart above the table plots
the areas, holes or stations you

V3a-2
00:01:16.538 --> 00:01:20.076
pick in its multiselect,
whichever level the table is showing.

V3b-1
00:01:20.586 --> 00:01:24.782
Selecting a row in the table changes the
chart header to that area or hole and

V3b-2
00:01:24.882 --> 00:01:29.186
its average moisture, so the chart and
the table always describe the same thing.

V4a-1
00:01:35.616 --> 00:01:39.351
The table is a drill-down:
course, then areas, then holes,

V4a-2
00:01:39.451 --> 00:01:43.316
then stations. Breadcrumbs at
the top left take you back up.

V4b-1
00:01:43.866 --> 00:01:48.748
At station level you get the editable
columns: Target VWC, the current and

V4b-2
00:01:48.848 --> 00:01:54.126
suggested adjustment side by side, your
own % Adj. value, and the Enable switch.

V5a-1
00:02:01.483 --> 00:02:04.351
The right of the toolbar
is your work queue.

V5a-2
00:02:04.451 --> 00:02:07.906
Push Changes counts the
enabled stations whose % Adj.

V5a-3
00:02:08.006 --> 00:02:13.353
differs from what Lynx holds, edited or
not, leaving out any already pushed today.

V5b-1
00:02:13.916 --> 00:02:17.578
The green counter beside it counts
stations already pushed today.

V5b-2
00:02:17.678 --> 00:02:20.496
When both are quiet,
there is nothing outstanding.
